OL,3,GNEWSASoggy start to West Show brings
OL,4,Asnags for vendors
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses setting up stalls endured
OL,7,Fwet and windy conditions as the first
OL,8,Fday of the West Show got underway.
OL,10,FThousands of people are expected to
OL,11,Fattend the two-day agricultural event
OL,12,Fat the L'Eree Aerodrome, St Peter's, on
OL,13,F19 and 20 August.
OL,15,FEmma Warden, owner of candle company
OL,16,FMelting Moments Guernsey said: "One of
OL,17,Fus was holding the gazebo from blowing
OL,18,Faway and the other two were trying to
OL,19,Fdry ourselves out and set up the
OL,20,Fproducts."
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
